      "text": "Am I my brother’s keeper, Gen. 4:9 (Moses 5:34). not harden thine heart … from thy poor brother, Deut. 15:7. see thy brother’s ox or his sheep go astray, Deut. 22:1. Ruth said … thy people shall be my people, Ruth 1:16. Jonathan loved him as his own soul, 1 Sam. 18:1. as though he had been my friend or brother, Ps. 35:14. A brother offended is harder to be won, Prov. 18:19. a friend that sticketh closer than a brother, Prov. 18:24.",
